# Exchanges a valid refresh token for a new access + refresh pair (rotation:
# the presented refresh token is invalidated as part of this call). Copy a
# real refresh_token value from a tenancy.login.rest response first — the
# placeholder below will correctly return 401.

### Happy path (replace refresh_token with a real value from /tenants/login)
POST http://localhost:8080/tenants/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "REPLACE_WITH_REAL_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Invalid/expired/already-used refresh token — expect 401
POST http://localhost:8080/tenants/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "not-a-real-token"
}
